//- Board views listed in the "Board View" switcher menu (boardHeader.jade)
  that do not have a real implementation yet. Each is a plain grey page - the
  same .stats-view/.stats-view-content/.stats-view-title shell statsView.jade
  uses - with its title matching the menu entry that opens it, and one shared
  "not implemented yet" note. Replace a template here with a real one (and
  drop it from this file) as each view gets built.

template(name="dashboardView")
  .stats-view
    .stats-view-content
      h1.stats-view-title {{_ 'board-view-dashboard'}}
      p.stats-view-placeholder-note {{_ 'board-view-not-yet-implemented'}}

